## Don't optimise for the lowest price

The cheapest Cardiff web designer isn't the best value. A website that doesn't rank on Google, doesn't convert visitors into enquiries, or needs to be rebuilt in two years because it was done badly the first time costs far more than one that was done properly from the start.

What you're actually investing in is a tool that generates leads for your business. Framed that way, the question isn't "how cheap can I get a website?" — it's "what's the cost of a website that actually works?"

